    "gp_section_628182914689073763": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "1c743a592381737495f98b20f1b55fe3925e5e889818964dfaed27809dd9497e_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg13DkAKWzH_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T103034.754.png",
        "gg2Y00t8OJh_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Where to Find ThePhotoStick Omni</strong></span></p>",
        "gg2kcpiQdtX_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_Marsha_Holding_Unit_Wide.png",
        "gg62-SJsX0F_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T112556.339.png",
        "gg8Pv9VtE3K_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Then I Found ThePhotoStick® Omni</strong></span></p>",
        "ggAFvi7tmsK_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">One of my favorite features is the ability to <strong>scan printed photos.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I have boxes filled with old family pictures from years ago—photos of my grandparents, my parents when they were young, and pictures of my children that only existed in print.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Using ThePhotoStick Omni's mobile app, <strong>I can scan those printed photos and create digital copies of memories</strong> that were once tucked away in albums and boxes.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Now, even my oldest family memories feel safer than ever.</span></p>",
        "ggCeGi_dxdJ_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I had spent years carefully preserving memories for my family, yet <strong>I hadn't done enough to protect the digital photos</strong> that mattered just as much.</span></p>",
        "ggE1CRaGO1n_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T104507.512.png",
        "ggEpH-rYk-J_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">One of my old phones suddenly stopped working.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">At first, I wasn't worried. Surely my photos were backed up somewhere… right?</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><i><strong>Wrong.</strong></i></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Years of pictures and videos were simply gone.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Some of them I had already printed and added to my scrapbooks, but many of them were still sitting on that device, waiting for me to print them someday.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I lost family vacations, candid moments, and everyday memories that can never be recreated.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I was heartbroken.</span></p>",
        "ggGTbMUEkXW_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">As someone who loves scrapbooking, I have thousands of photos that haven't made it into albums yet.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Now, I don't have to panic every time my phone storage gets full or wonder what would happen if a device stopped working.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I know my digital memories are protected.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And that peace of mind is priceless.</span></p>",
        "ggIZh9LPhEW_text": "<p><strong>▶ Protect Thousands of Precious Memories</strong><br>Whether it's baby photos, family vacations, birthdays, or everyday moments, ThePhotoStick Omni helps back up and organize over 204,000 photos and videos, so your memories are protected for years to come.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>▶ Works With Nearly Every Device</strong><br>I have photos scattered across my phone, tablet, and computer. Thankfully, ThePhotoStick Omni works with multiple devices, making it easy to keep all my memories together in one place.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>▶ Bring Old Printed Photos Back to Life</strong><br>Some of my favorite family memories only existed in old photo albums and boxes. The companion app lets me scan printed photos and turn them into digital copies, helping preserve generations of memories before they fade or become damaged.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>▶ Incredibly Easy to Use</strong><br>I'm a scrapbooker, not a tech expert. That's why I love how simple ThePhotoStick Omni is. Just connect it, follow a few easy steps in the app, and start protecting your memories.</p>",
        "ggI_cvq8Qt2_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>It Even Helped Me Protect My Old Printed Photos</strong></span></p>",
        "ggKo977aXx-_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">You can’t slow time down.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">But you can protect a lifetime of memories before they’re gone.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Choosing ThePhotoStick Omni was <strong>the best decision for peace of mind to protect my family’s memories.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">You can only find ThePhotoStick Omni on their </span><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>official website</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Not only is it <strong>HALF THE PRICE of cloud storage</strong>, but it also requires just a one-time purchase for lifetime use!</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Even better, they're currently offering <strong>HUGE discounts starting at 50% OFF!</strong> I'm using the 256GB version, and it's been great. ☺️ I just wish they had this special going when I bought mine!</span></p>",
        "ggQ5Dp_czZe_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>To use </strong></span><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>, just follow these three easy steps:</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Step One:</strong> Download the FREE app from the Google Play Store or the App Store.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Step Two:</strong> Plug ThePhotoStick Omni into your device. Once connected, it will automatically begin finding and backing up all your photos, videos, and other files.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Step Three:</strong> Once your backup has completed, disconnect ThePhotoStick Omni from your device. Then, plug ThePhotoStick Omni directly into your laptop to transfer files, or leave your files safely stored on the USB drive.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That’s it!</span></p>",
        "ggQegUKjj5w_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T105709.615.png",
        "ggTaZtSqFps_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Why You’ll Love </strong></span><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong> As Much As I Do</strong></span></p>",
        "ggVPSVfIsqo_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I immediately started looking for a way to protect the thousands of photos and videos scattered across my phone, tablet, and computer.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Normal USB drives only work with my computer, not my portable devices, and cloud services are way too expensive (I shouldn’t have to pay for MY memories!)</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I needed something that would help me protect the memories no matter where they were stored.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That's when I discovered </span><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">.</span></p>",
        "ggVuiYyCpKI_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And honestly? It felt like a huge weight had been lifted off my shoulders.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>ThePhotoStick Omni helps me back up and organize my photos and videos from all my devices</strong> in one convenient place.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No complicated setup.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No monthly fees.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">No worrying about where my memories are stored.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Just <strong>a simple way to protect the moments that mean the most</strong></span></p>",
        "ggaLjpcMARz_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>The Day I Realized My Memories Weren't Actually Safe</strong></span></p>",
        "ggal0Qhp1hI_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And if you ever need help, there's <strong>easy-to-access customer support</strong> on their website, plus a helpful FAQ and support center for any questions.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">This was really comforting for me, especially when I was nervous about trying something new.</span></p>",
        "gggufm_0RG1_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">As the family memory keeper, I've learned something important: It's not enough to preserve memories.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">You have to protect them, too.</span></p><p><br><a href=\"http://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong> has given me something I didn't realize I needed—peace of mind.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I can keep creating scrapbooks, printing photos, and documenting our family's story knowing that the memories I cherish most are finally safe.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Because every photo tells a story.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">And every story deserves to be protected.</span></p>",
        "ggkBY88em1h_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>A Backup Solution Made for Memory Keepers</strong></span></p>",
        "ggpah84uQ0b_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">By the time my kids were old enough to appreciate them, I had already filled shelves with scrapbooks.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Birthday parties. Family vacations. First days of school. Christmas mornings.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>I've always been the memory keeper in my family.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">I'm the one who prints the photos, labels the albums, and saves every little moment because I know how quickly time passes.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">But a few months ago, <strong>something happened that completely changed the way I think about preserving memories.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggpbrHxeQTQ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-06T144724.193.png",
        "ggtJYcch0Mk_text": "<p><strong>▶ Small Enough to Go Anywhere</strong><br>Its compact, durable design means I can take it with me wherever life happens. Whether I'm on vacation, visiting family, or organizing photos at home, my backup solution is always within reach.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>▶ Peace of Mind You Can't Put a Price On</strong><br>The best feature of all? Knowing that the photos and videos that tell my family's story are safe. I no longer worry about losing precious memories to a broken phone, damaged computer, or accidental deletion.</p>",
        "gguZwNTvWvo_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T113414.585.png",
        "ggvUZgQuHYX_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T102952.819.png",
        "ggwgCd77PY0_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Because Memories Deserve More Than One Copy</strong></span></p>",
